Source: grub-btrfs
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: KOOMPI <packages@koompi.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: grub-btrfs
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, grub2-common, btrfs-progs, inotify-tools
Description: GRUB submenu of Btrfs snapshots, and a daemon that regenerates it
 Not packaged in Debian's archive (see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §4.2).
 Vendored from upstream (github.com/Antynea/grub-btrfs) and packaged here
 because every KOOMPI edition needs boot-into-snapshot. grub-btrfsd
 watches /.snapshots via inotify and regenerates the GRUB snapshot
 submenu whenever a snapshot appears or disappears.
